💡 anti-hall · idle-agents: 1 finished agent is idle and not closed: a0 (60m).
Why: an open agent holds a thread slot until it is closed.
Do instead: if you have no more work for them, close each one, e.g. close_agent {"target":"a0"} (one call per agent). Keep any you will re-task.
